1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,680
Two woodcutters sheltered from a deadly snowstorm.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,460
During the night,

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,380
a pale woman entered,

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,900
and one man died beneath her freezing

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,469
breath.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,080
She spared the younger man,

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,620
Minokichi, only if he never told anyone

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,660
what he had seen.

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,360
By morning she had vanished into the

10
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:21,760
blizzard.

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:26,180
Minokichi later married a beautiful woman called

12
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,260
O-Yuki. They built a life together and

13
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:33,160
raised children; the winter vision slowly became

14
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,585
a secret memory.

15
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,880
One evening he told his wife the

16
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,120
old tale. As he spoke,

17
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:43,900
she changed: O-Yuki was the very woman

18
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:46,160
who had made him promise silence.

19
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,560
She was furious that he had broken

20
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:52,400
his word, but for their children she

21
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,580
spared his life.

22
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,919
Then she disappeared into the night.

23
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,420
He kept the family,

24
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,740
but lost the woman he loved.

25
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,820
Some promises are not tested until a

26
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:04,898
lifetime has passed.
